xE7nEDdQ5XkQ7kNvwE_dW56&_nc_oc=Adoaiuft_3wHOqjUf_ID0t0vBoAsKTbG8VQ2OipIjKfaTmwHXEf79HYd1RQqz5Ke5Gw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJpgpMh5nSronzzPaZLol0Agbb_KUInvZ7aFrQnrIa1bA&oe=6AB3DEB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1Bk-RsQNcJsQ7kNvwHKHsBz&_nc_oc=AdpEFG5-lvO0Z_KRNoJwjXDFAI5FGxlYJAnCMJHUIByIng_PpwrCGAkquZ_B-4THTUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIkMETM5oVNUSnQIwIEq9W25oP4MtbVAWF3UcpHmLhm4A&oe=6AB3E04A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OlAlH7iFpx8Q7kNvwG_Z46G&_nc_oc=AdoVMe0d6y9t6nvO9S2nqtpQp7mFgv1icrVKc3nys0LYwNF3qYlA7U2-uN9ejrVi3FM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKe1J0NhCEixZbaERPA4LIQRQBjAnqFSJBSnbcjRk_e7Q&oe=6AB3CD6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ljsAYDW_jBQQ7kNvwFIiInL&_nc_oc=AdpAwq3PoolChQEtPr5VW5r-_NG_i13fDQy1_UerMbwbFgRI5sdNbNSPQ71d3ASWc2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKCp8RVB_vk_HO6Mc4LWXeu7nmgeGLosX7tSvFMSGNhVQ&oe=6AB3EF03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qlBjkeEQ7DIQ7kNvwHpFJ7O&_nc_oc=AdpnyWI8EGgG7_zPtUE7p9qDZnRoTJpsuPTZ8sdOrh1L1GHLyJxz4lwnU9qce3rVJw0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL8zO3rbmDJP5Uh_HN1AmduE_1n0Zxqauw6PSGrwkYzNQ&oe=6AB3E758"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7842-X3JYoQ7kNvwEfy9r4&_nc_oc=Adp1pylOnNiHuyALWPMQX9PqodXe9xrz6BAjn_JLxuuvoXkWWMODGmhZSxob6W-0gXA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQICEvgoIyCq8XEmF_0JqDCBIMEOr-rKIc86sC8LTQ-gCg&oe=6AB3C23C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080